TITLE
Fintech Mobile Banking Customer Insights: Sentiment and Thematic Analysis
1. Executive Summary

This project analyzes over 1,200 mobile banking reviews from Ethiopian banks using NLP techniques. The goal is to understand customer sentiment, extract key themes, and provide actionable business insights.

2. Methodology
Data collected using Google Play scraping
Cleaned and preprocessed using NLP pipeline
Sentiment classification using DistilBERT
Theme extraction using TF-IDF and keyword grouping
Visualization using Matplotlib
3. Key Findings
Customer Satisfaction Drivers
Simple UI design
Fast navigation
Reliable mobile access
Pain Points
Login and authentication failures
Transaction delays
App instability
4. Bank Comparison
CBE: Highest complaints, system reliability issues
BOA: Best UI experience
Dashen: Highest overall sentiment score
5. Recommendations
CBE
Improve backend stability
Fix authentication system
BOA
Improve app stability
Add advanced features
Dashen
Improve transaction speed
Expand feature offerings
6. Conclusion

The study shows that system performance and usability are the most important drivers of customer satisfaction in mobile banking applications.